        "ParentObjectID": "fl_bog_body",
        "LocalizationKey": "Forest_Lore_BogBody_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A shape in the cut face of the peat: a man, curled on his side, brown and creased as old leather, his skin and hair kept by the acid of the bog long after everything else about him was forgotten. A corroded green band is still clasped about one arm. He lies where the cutters found him and will not be found twice."
    },
